# Force LF line endings for all text files in this repo, regardless of the
# checking-out machine's core.autocrlf setting. Windows' autocrlf=true
# default rewrites checked-out .js files to CRLF, which then fails
# eslint-config-airbnb-extended's linebreak-style rule and makes git think
# unmodified files are "changed" after any checkout/branch switch (blocking
# `git checkout`, `gh pr merge`, etc. with phantom conflicts).
* text=auto eol=lf
